			"notes": "# New features :sparkles: \n\n- Added an integrated disassembler for signal formatting.\n- Redstone lamps now configurable as signals.\n- Support for IEEE-754 16 and 32 bit floating point formats.\n\n# Improvements\n\n- Massively improved command line completion!\n- Mod will now remember profiles on a per world/server basis.\n\n# Bugfixes\n\n- Too many to count :grimacing: \n\n# Dependencies\n\n- fabric-api: https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\n- fabric-language-kotlin: https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin"
		},
