			"notes": "# Enhancements\n\n- Add profile pages (can be cycled with hotkeys `[` and `]` by default).\n- Add profile columns (split signals on a page across columns).\n- Improve appearance of overlay.\n- Add autocomplete to type and format command fields.\n- Add hotkey to toggle overlay (default hotkey is `=`).\n- Numerous command interface improvements.\n- Improve compatibility with past storage versions.\n\n# Bugfixes\n\n- Active profile is now reset when loading a world.\n- Fixed inconsistent profile selection position (rounding issue).\n- Remove erroneous profile name argument from deselect command.\n\n# Dependencies\n\n- fabric-api: https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\n- fabric-language-kotlin: https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin"
